<![CDATA[<p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">You have a new project for resource assignment. To assign please do the following&nbsp;<br><ul><li>Navigate to project record</li><li>Click related tab</li><li>Click on Resource Request link</li><li>Search in the Resource Name</li><li>Click Filter Resource</li><li>Click assign</li></ul></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Client #:&nbsp;{!pse__Proj__c.NSP_RET_Client_ID__c}</p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Start Date:&nbsp;{!pse__Proj__c.pse__Start_Date__c}</p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">To review related project details, please click the following link:&nbsp;{!pse__Proj__c.Link}</p>]]></td>
